Triple-Buffering<size:3>{
}<size:29>{
<b>{Off:} Double-buffering (for best latency). <size:3>{
}
<b>{On:} Triple-buffering (for best framerate stability). }

Upscale Mode<size:3>{
}<size:29>{
Improves image quality and performance through upscaling, sharpening and anti-aliasing.<size:3>{
}
<b>{Bilinear:} Cheap upscaling with no sharpening.<size:3>{
}
<b>{NIS (Default):} High Quality GPU upscaling and sharpening.<size:3>{
}
<b>{AMD FSR:} A cutting-edge temporal upscaling and anti-aliasing algorithm. FSR is not supported on DirectX 11.<size:3>{
}
<b>{Intel XeSS:} Uses AI to deliver high quality upscaling and anti-aliasing. This feature is only available on DirectX 12 and performs best on Intel Arc GPUs<size:3>{
}
<b>{NVIDIA DLSS:} Performs fast upscaling and anti-aliasing while maintaining great image quality through the use of hardware-accelerated AI. Requires a GeForce RTX graphics card.}

